#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:5
msgid "AIBrix Architecture"
msgstr "AIBrix 架构"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:7
msgid ""
"An overview of AIBrix’s architecture. This guide introduces the AIBrix "
"ecosystem and explains how its components integrate into the LLM "
"inference lifecycle."
msgstr "本文概述 AIBrix 架构，介绍 AIBrix 生态系统，并说明各组件如何融入 LLM 推理生命周期。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:9
msgid ""
"AIBrix contains both :strong:`control plane` components and :strong:`data"
" plane` components. The control plane decides what runs and where: it "
"turns AIBrix custom resources into workloads, routes, caches and scaling "
"decisions, and it hosts the management services around them. The data "
"plane carries the traffic: inference requests and responses, and the KV "
"cache data that engines share. Envoy forwards each request directly to an"
" engine pod, so inference traffic does not pass through the controllers."
msgstr ""
"AIBrix 同时包含 :strong:`控制面` 组件和 :strong:`数据面` 组件。控制面决定运行什么、在哪里运行：它将 AIBrix "
"自定义资源转化为工作负载、路由、缓存和扩缩容决策，并承载周边的管理服务。数据面承载流量：推理请求与响应，以及引擎之间共享的 KVCache "
"数据。Envoy 将每个请求直接转发到引擎 Pod，因此推理流量不会经过控制器。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:11
msgid "The following diagram shows how the two planes fit together on Kubernetes."
msgstr "下图展示了这两个面如何在 Kubernetes 上协同工作。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:13
msgid "aibrix-architecture-v2"
msgstr "aibrix-architecture-v2"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:19
msgid "AIBrix Control Plane"
msgstr "AIBrix 控制面"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:21
msgid ""
"Most control plane logic runs in one controller manager, ``aibrix-"
"controller-manager`` in the ``aibrix-system`` namespace. Each controller "
"in the table below can be turned on or off with the manager's "
"``--controllers`` flag, for example ``--controllers=*,-model-claim-"
"controller``. The manager also serves the validating and defaulting "
"admission webhooks for the AIBrix custom resources. A mutating webhook on"
" Deployments injects the AI Engine Runtime sidecar into Deployments "
"annotated with ``model.aibrix.ai/sidecar-injection: \"true\"``."
msgstr ""
"大部分控制面逻辑运行在同一个控制器管理器中，即 ``aibrix-system`` 命名空间下的 ``aibrix-controller-"
"manager`` 。下表中的每个控制器都可以通过管理器的 ``--controllers`` 参数启用或禁用，例如 "
"``--controllers=*,-model-claim-controller`` 。管理器还为 AIBrix "
"自定义资源提供校验和默认值设置的准入 webhook。Deployment 上的变更 webhook 会为带有 ``model.aibrix.ai"
"/sidecar-injection: \"true\"`` 注解的 Deployment 注入 AI Engine Runtime "
"sidecar。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:27
msgid "Controller"
msgstr "控制器"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:28
msgid "Resources"
msgstr "资源"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:29
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:30
msgid "``model-route-controller``"
msgstr "``model-route-controller``"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:31
msgid ""
"Deployment, ModelAdapter, RayClusterFleet, LeaderWorkerSet (when its CRD "
"is installed)"
msgstr "Deployment、ModelAdapter、RayClusterFleet、LeaderWorkerSet（已安装其 CRD 时）"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:32
msgid ""
"Creates and removes the Gateway API ``HTTPRoute`` for each served model, "
"so the gateway can reach new models without manual configuration."
msgstr "为每个对外提供服务的模型创建和删除 Gateway API ``HTTPRoute`` ，使网关无需手动配置即可访问新模型。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:33
msgid "``model-adapter-controller``"
msgstr "``model-adapter-controller``"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:34
msgid "ModelAdapter"
msgstr "ModelAdapter"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:35
msgid ""
"Registers a LoRA adapter on the matching pods through the AI Engine "
"Runtime, configures service discovery and reports the adapter's status. "
"This enables multi-LoRA-per-pod deployments."
msgstr ""
"通过 AI Engine Runtime 将 LoRA 适配器注册到匹配的 Pod，配置服务发现并上报适配器状态，从而支持单 Pod 部署多个 "
"LoRA。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:36
msgid "``stormservice-controller``"
msgstr "``stormservice-controller``"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:37
msgid "StormService, RoleSet, PodSet"
msgstr "StormService, RoleSet, PodSet"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:38
msgid ""
"Manages multi-role inference services such as prefill/decode "
"disaggregation. Updates flow from StormService to RoleSets to roles and "
"Pods, with rolling and in-place updates and graceful Pod draining on "
"rollout and scale-in."
msgstr ""
"管理多角色推理服务，例如 Prefill/Decode 分离。更新自 StormService 依次传递到 RoleSet、角色和 "
"Pod，支持滚动更新与原地更新，并在发布和缩容时对 Pod 执行 Drain（优雅排空）。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:39
msgid "``pod-autoscaler-controller``"
msgstr "``pod-autoscaler-controller``"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:40
msgid "PodAutoscaler"
msgstr "PodAutoscaler"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:41
msgid ""
"Scales Deployments, RayClusterFleets and StormService roles with the HPA,"
" KPA or APA strategy, using inference-aware engine metrics. It also "
"supports daily scheduled replica bounds and optional predictive scaling."
msgstr ""
"使用 HPA、KPA 或 APA 策略，基于推理相关的引擎指标对 Deployment、RayClusterFleet 和 "
"StormService 角色进行扩缩容。同时支持按天定时设置副本上下限，以及可选的预测式扩缩容。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:42
msgid "``distributed-inference-controller``"
msgstr "``distributed-inference-controller``"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:43
msgid "RayClusterFleet, RayClusterReplicaSet"
msgstr "RayClusterFleet, RayClusterReplicaSet"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:44
msgid ""
"Orchestrates multi-node inference on KubeRay. It starts only when the "
"KubeRay CRD (``rayclusters.ray.io``) is installed."
msgstr "基于 KubeRay 编排多节点推理。仅在已安装 KubeRay CRD（ ``rayclusters.ray.io`` ）时启动。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:45
msgid "``kv-cache-controller``"
msgstr "``kv-cache-controller``"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:46
msgid "KVCache"
msgstr "KVCache"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:47
msgid ""
"Deploys and manages a distributed KV cache cluster with an InfiniStore, "
"HPKV or Vineyard backend. For InfiniStore and HPKV, an optional watcher "
"Pod records the cache-node membership in Redis."
msgstr ""
"部署并管理使用 InfiniStore、HPKV 或 Vineyard 后端的分布式 KVCache 集群。对于 InfiniStore 和 "
"HPKV，可选的 watcher Pod 会将缓存节点成员信息记录到 Redis。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:48
msgid "``model-claim-controller`` (experimental)"
msgstr "``model-claim-controller`` （实验性）"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:49
msgid "ModelClaim"
msgstr "ModelClaim"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:50
msgid ""
"Serves several models from the same GPUs. It places each claim on a warm-"
"pool Pod with room for it, starts the engine through the runtime agent, "
"and can put idle models to sleep. The gateway asks it to wake a sleeping "
"model when a request arrives."
msgstr ""
"让多个模型共用同一批 GPU。它将每个 claim 放置到有空余容量的热池 Pod 上，通过 runtime agent "
"启动引擎，并可让空闲模型进入休眠。请求到达时，网关会请求它唤醒处于休眠状态的模型。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:51
msgid "``model-warmup-controller`` (experimental)"
msgstr "``model-warmup-controller`` （实验性）"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:52
msgid "ModelWarmup"
msgstr "ModelWarmup"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:53
msgid ""
"Runs a one-time, node-pinned Job on each selected node to pull images or "
"download artifacts ahead of use. It does not start an engine."
msgstr "在每个选定节点上运行一次性的、绑定到该节点的 Job，用于提前拉取镜像或下载制品。它不会启动引擎。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:55
msgid "Several control plane components run outside the controller manager:"
msgstr "有几个控制面组件运行在控制器管理器之外："

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:57
msgid ""
":strong:`AI Engine Runtime`: a lightweight sidecar next to each engine. "
"It standardizes engine metrics, downloads model weights from HuggingFace,"
" S3 or TOS, loads and unloads LoRA adapters, and starts, sleeps and wakes"
" engine processes for ModelClaim. It does not proxy inference traffic."
msgstr ""
":strong:`AI Engine Runtime` ：与每个引擎部署在一起的轻量 sidecar。它负责标准化引擎指标，从 "
"HuggingFace、S3 或 TOS 下载模型权重，加载和卸载 LoRA 适配器，并为 ModelClaim "
"启动、休眠和唤醒引擎进程。它不代理推理流量。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:58
msgid ""
":strong:`GPU Optimizer`: a profiler-based optimizer for heterogeneous GPU"
" serving. It adjusts allocations to maximize cost-efficiency while "
"maintaining service guarantees."
msgstr ""
":strong:`GPU Optimizer` ：基于性能剖析的优化器，面向异构 GPU "
"推理服务。它动态调整资源分配，在满足服务保障的同时提升成本效率。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:59
msgid ""
":strong:`Metadata service`: serves the OpenAI-compatible Files and Batch "
"APIs and runs batches as Kubernetes Jobs."
msgstr ""
":strong:`元数据服务` ：提供与 OpenAI 兼容的 Files 和 Batch API，并以 Kubernetes Job "
"的方式运行批处理任务。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:60
msgid ""
":strong:`Console`: a web UI with a Go gRPC and REST backend. It manages "
"the model catalog, deployments, batch jobs, API keys, secrets and quotas,"
" and offers a chat playground that proxies to the gateway."
msgstr ""
":strong:`控制台` ：Web UI 加 Go 编写的 gRPC 和 REST 后端。用于管理模型目录、部署、批处理作业、API "
"Key、Secret 和配额，并提供经由网关代理的对话 playground。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:63
msgid "AIBrix Data Plane"
msgstr "AIBrix 数据面"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:65
msgid "AIBrix currently provides several data plane components:"
msgstr "AIBrix 当前提供以下数据面组件："

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:67
msgid ""
":strong:`AIBrix gateway`: built on Envoy Gateway, with the AIBrix gateway"
" plugin attached as an external-processing (``ext_proc``) extension. It "
"is the single entry point for inference requests. It routes from a local "
"cache of ready pods and engine metrics, so most strategies need no live "
"query to a pod. Gateway replicas share rate-limit counters, and "
"optionally the prefix cache index, through Redis."
msgstr ""
":strong:`AIBrix 网关` ：基于 Envoy Gateway 构建，AIBrix 网关插件以外部处理（ ``ext_proc`` "
"）扩展的方式接入。它是推理请求的唯一入口。它基于本地缓存的就绪 Pod 和引擎指标进行路由，因此大多数策略无需实时查询 Pod。网关副本通过 "
"Redis 共享限流计数器，也可选择共享前缀缓存索引。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:68
msgid ""
":strong:`Inference engines`: the Pods that serve the model. AIBrix "
"supports vLLM, SGLang, xLLM and TRT-LLM, selected with the "
"``model.aibrix.ai/engine`` label. In prefill/decode disaggregation, "
"dedicated prefill and decode Pods split the two phases of a request."
msgstr ""
":strong:`推理引擎` ：承载模型服务的 Pod。AIBrix 支持 vLLM、SGLang、xLLM 和 TRT-LLM，通过 "
"``model.aibrix.ai/engine`` 标签选择。在 Prefill/Decode 分离中，专用的 Prefill Pod 和 "
"Decode Pod 分别负责请求的两个阶段。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:69
msgid ""
":strong:`Distributed KV Cache Runtime`: provides scalable, low-latency "
"cache access across nodes. Engines connect through the AIBrix KV cache "
"offloading framework, with an L1 DRAM cache and an optional L2 "
"distributed cache. The L2 cache lets engines reuse each other's KV cache "
"entries and avoid redundant computation."
msgstr ""
":strong:`分布式 KVCache 运行时` ：在节点间提供可扩展、低延迟的缓存访问。引擎通过 AIBrix KVCache "
"卸载框架接入，包含 L1 DRAM 缓存和可选的 L2 分布式缓存。L2 缓存使引擎可以复用彼此的 KVCache 条目，避免重复计算。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:70
msgid ""
":strong:`KV event sync`: an optional feature in which engines publish KV "
"cache events over ZMQ. The gateway builds a global prefix index from "
"them, so prefix-cache routing follows the real state of each engine."
msgstr ""
":strong:`KV Cache 事件同步` ：可选功能，引擎通过 ZMQ 发布 KVCache "
"事件。网关据此构建全局前缀索引，使前缀缓存路由能够反映各引擎的真实状态。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:72
msgid "A request passes through the data plane as follows:"
msgstr "请求在数据面中的流转过程如下："

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:74
