msgstr "Envoy 通过 ``ext_proc`` 将请求交给网关插件。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:75
msgid ""
"The plugin identifies the model. When configured, it also checks the "
"bearer token."
msgstr "插件识别请求的模型。在已配置时，还会检查 Bearer 令牌。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:76
msgid ""
"The plugin selects a ready pod with a routing strategy and returns it to "
"Envoy in the ``target-pod`` header. Strategies fall into these groups:"
msgstr "插件使用路由策略选择一个就绪的 Pod，并通过 ``target-pod`` 请求头将其返回给 Envoy。策略分为以下几类："

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:78
msgid ""
"load balancing, such as ``random``, ``least-request``, ``load-balance`` "
"and ``power-of-two``"
msgstr ""
"负载均衡，例如 ``random`` 、 ``least-request`` 、 ``load-balance`` 和 ``power-of-"
"two``"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:79
msgid "KV-cache aware, such as ``prefix-cache``"
msgstr "KVCache 感知，例如 ``prefix-cache``"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:80
msgid "fairness, ``vtc-basic``"
msgstr "公平性， ``vtc-basic``"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:81
msgid "SLO-aware, such as ``slo``"
msgstr "SLO 感知，例如 ``slo``"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:82
msgid "session affinity, ``session-affinity``"
msgstr "会话亲和， ``session-affinity``"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:83
msgid "prefill/decode disaggregation, ``pd``"
msgstr "Prefill/Decode 分离， ``pd``"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:84
msgid "delegation to an operator-run service, ``external``"
msgstr "委托给运维方运行的服务， ``external``"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:86
msgid ""
"Envoy forwards the request straight to that engine pod, which uses the KV"
" cache layers when they are enabled."
msgstr "Envoy 将请求直接转发到该引擎 Pod；启用 KVCache 层时，引擎会使用这些缓存层。"

#: ../../source/designs/architecture.rst:87
msgid "The response returns through the plugin."
msgstr "响应经由插件返回。"

